{"id":3961,"name":"Hyouken no Majutsushi ga Sekai wo Suberu","slug":"hyouken_no_majutsushi_ga_sekai_wo_suberu","synopsis":"The Iceblade Sorcerer is hailed as the most powerful sorcerer in the world. The one who inherited this title, Ray White, struggles to deal with his own immense power. After fighting in the Far East War, his last accomplishment, he vanished from the battlefield along with a deeply scarred psyche. Three years have passed since then, and Ray has enrolled at the Arnold Academy of Magic, a school attended by elite sorcerers from around the world. \n\r\n\n\r\nRay is the first \"Ordinary\" to attend this academy since it was founded, so he's greeted by looks of scorn and contempt from its noble-born students. And now, he and the priceless friends he has found there are about to become entangled in multiple schemes. So begins the story of the most powerful sorcerer's school life filled with both friendship and hardship. \n\r\n\n\r\n(Source: Crunchyroll)","format":"TV","season":"WINTER","year":2023,"createdAt":"2023-01-04 03:43:58","updatedAt":"2023-01-04 03:43:58","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":148116},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46088},{"site":"MAL","externalId":51711},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17341},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":19431},{"site":"ANN","externalId":25582},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"CRUNCHYROLL","externalId":null}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":10563,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/vi6M8qYtjDso1glptapRgMhfySNHYXvSufVhI9XW.jpg"},{"id":10564,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/gs4NsTdl4cKM2EGAHh8Dzy8MStWamLslCtieTxYc.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":384,"name":"Cloud Hearts","slug":"cloud_hearts"}]},"series":{"nodes":[]},"animethemes":[{"id":11995,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":11987,"title":"Dystopia","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":13998,"version":1,"episodes":"1-12","nsfw":false,"spoiler